    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nName 2 reasons why TMP-SMX can lead to excessive bleeding when used with Warfarin\n\nThere is an increase in free Warfarin concentrate due to:\n\n(1) Inhibition of CYP450 system\n(2) Displacement from albumin\n\n[Image: 869b45be934dc303ca78308bfdc0b3453d5bd9d2dd6474c6c43c8cb0507a692f]\n\n[Image: 7800c677d8207daa01333f117c00e8a312a407d3dc784e124fa2157c0f4f2ff3]\n\n4.1 - Trimethoprim/Sulfamethoxazole\n[Image: 37c2cd24e0dbf7e6dab13595c23d90bc2c210bdefbc5d2cdc2444e105608a9da]\n\n[Image: 415ae7ac37e8deff6edded3b983bc93ed29481d92586c3b4cd6b30e8cffdbcb9]\n\n[Image: 302471b7496c79a2f2bed549939836e9977f92a9a73671da6d63dbed58856d70]",
